+            """.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8)), "test-failure-policy.yaml").parsePolicy());
+        assertEquals(
+            "[3:7] policy parsing error for [test-failure-policy.yaml] in scope [entitlement-module-name]: "
+                + "unknown entitlement type [does_not_exist]",
